  "_id": "I8AfSwfwREJEgt0W",
  "name": "Dragonblight",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/statuses/cursed.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Amellwind Condition</strong></p><p>While afflicted with dragonblight, the target can't deal cold, fire, lightning, necrotic, or thunder damage with its spells and attacks, and it can't impose any of the following conditions on other creatures: blinded, charmed, paralyzed, poisoned, and petrified. Dragonblight can be cured early with the <em>lesser restoration</em> spell or similar magic.</p>\n<p><em>Token status indicates the affliction; elemental lockout is enforced at the table / by boss macros.</em></p>\n<p><em>Toggle from the token HUD, or use <strong>Apply Affliction</strong> (Midi applies the Active Effect + status icon).</em></p>",
      "chat": "<p>Can't deal cold/fire/lightning/necrotic/thunder damage; can't impose blinded, charmed, paralyzed, poisoned, or petrified.</p>"
    },
